FADE IN:

INT. MOUNTAIN OPERATIONS ROOM - DAWN

[[AMBIENCE: radio hiss, distant engines, wind against canvas]]
[[MUSIC: restrained military tension]]

A map of the operational area is spread across a table. CAPTAIN ELIAN and MIRA stand over it.

LENKA
(serious)
Both armies received forged orders from this hub. The evidence vault contains the original transmission keys.

[[SHOT: map]]
[[MAP: operational area, player start, objective route, enemy approach]]

COMMANDER SAVA
(measured)
Its defence system has no flag recognition. It will fire on whoever enters.

LENKA
(firm)
Secure the vault and disable the automated guns. We need the evidence intact, and we need it before the hub self-destructs.

[[SFX: radio click]]
[[MUSIC: stop]]

FADE OUT.
